<title>FRANCE: French stocks jump on CPI data.</title>
<headline>French stocks jump on CPI data.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>French shares jumped up after the publication of the U.S. March CPI figures which were lower than expected, brokers said.</p>
<p>The blue-chip CAC-40 index was up 34.47 points or 1.34 percent at 2,600.60 at 1237 GMT while the CAC-40 futures contract was up 39 at 2,601.</p>
</text>
